OL,3,AHow new US chip restrictions on South
OL,4,AEast Asia will hit China
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth East Asian countries in
OL,7,Fparticular have invested heavily in
OL,8,Fdata centres to power their AI
OL,9,Fambitions - and Chinese firms seeking
OL,10,Fcomputing power overseas have been a
OL,11,Fkey market.
